# Amazon SEO Services: Get Your Products to Page One and Keep Them There

Even If You Have A Number 1 Product On The Internet – The Problem Persists If You’re not on page 1 of Amazon, it’s irrelevant whether your product is best. That’s because over 70% of Amazon customers do not scroll down any further than the first page of Amazon’s results – turning visibility into a real loss of profit.

We have an Amazon SEO service solution designed to help you. In order for you to do it we will use optimization for all parts of the product listing, from keywords arrangement, the back end data of the products and the creation of a better content to your listing in terms of design and text and from there increase the number of visits. It will also result in an increase in the sales percentage for you to experience an organic development month by month.

---

## What Are Amazon SEO Services?

> Amazon SEO services consist of expert practices for boosting organic rank of a listing on amazon’s search results page as this involves keyword research, listing content, back end search terms, a+ content, review velocity as well as conversion rate optimization.

**At a glance, Amazon SEO covers:**

- Product title, bullet point, and description optimization
- Backend search term and keyword indexing management
- A+ Content and Brand Store creation
- Main image and visual sequence optimization
- Review acquisition and reputation management
- Conversion rate optimization (CRO)
- External traffic strategy for A10 algorithm advantage
- Competitor gap analysis and ongoing rank monitoring

---

![](/images/services/amazon-seo-services/Amazon%20seo%20services.webp)

## Why Amazon SEO Is Not Optional Anymore

This evolution from Amazon's original algorithm, A9, to A10 represents quite an improvement. It does not solely benefit the listing with more matches to search queries. This search ranking is determined by the conversion rate, velocity of sales, traffic outside of the platform, freshness of reviews, and the strength of the seller.

And it’s because of this complexity that sellers who guess – or use antiquated methods – continue losing to sellers who utilize Amazon SEO services. Sellers consistently doing well on Amazon understand that SEO is an ongoing effort – not a listing-setup event.

---

## Our Amazon SEO Services

### Listing Audit and Account Health Analysis

We begin each partnership with a full audit. We identify the silent issues holding back your rank – those missing product attributes, duplicated backend keywords, mistargeted categories, over-restricted ASINs, and content opportunities your competitors are pouncing on. You’ll see precisely what we need to fix.

### Keyword Research and Architecture

We do not build flat keyword lists. We build a **three-tier keyword architecture** mapped to real buyer intent:

- **Tier 1**-1 to 3 high-relevance primary keywords placed in your title
- **Tier 2**-5 to 10 mid-competition purchase-intent phrases in bullets and A+ content
- **Tier 3**-20 to 50+ long-tail terms covering use cases, materials, and buyer scenarios placed in backend fields

We use Helium 10, Jungle Scout, Amazon Brand Analytics, and reverse ASIN lookups-combined with Amazon's own Product Opportunity Explorer for search volume and conversion data no third-party tool can replicate.

### On-Page Listing Optimization

Every content element in your listing carries indexing and conversion value. We optimize:

- **Product title**-primary keyword placement, readability, and character compliance
- **Bullet points**-benefit-led copy with secondary keywords woven naturally
- **Product description**-brand narrative reinforcing feature depth and trust
- **Backend search terms**-full 250-byte utilization with synonyms, misspellings, and alternate phrases

### A+ Content and Brand Store Development

The use of A+ Content on Amazon is not merely aesthetic – Amazon itself states that A+ Content is “keyword-relevant and can be used to enhance both organic rank and conversion rates at the same time. The strategy of A+ Content has helped lift our average conversion rate from 5-10% on a per-ASIN basis. As such, we can also create a Brand Store to serve as your own customized microsite Amazon has and use your store to build brand value and drive multi-product cross-sell."

### Image and Video Optimization

These visuals make or break whether a qualified buyer clicks on your listing or your competition. Our strategically constructed images – compliant main image, context driven lifestyle shots, technical specs charts, competitive matrix and so on are strategically sequenced to increase both CTR & session time, the two live A10 ranking factors.

### Review Velocity and Reputation Management

Both review volume and review recency directly affect your Amazon ranking for organic traffic. To improve these areas of your listing, our review service employs Amazon’s Request a Review automation, post-purchase customer communication streams, Q&A monitoring and management, and effective responses to negative feedback-all to ensure consistent review volume and to preserve your Amazon star rating.

### Conversion Rate Optimization

That’s only part of the formula, though. We A/B test your titles and primary images with Amazon’s Manage Your Experiments tool, tune pricing against Buy Box behavior, and bake trust signals into your listing’s flow-and convert your organic traffic into organic sales.

---

## How Amazon's A10 Algorithm Works-And Why It Changes Everything

No serious Amazon SEO expert can survive the day without understanding the A10. How does the algorithm consider factors such as:

{% table %}
- Ranking Signal
- What It Measures
---
- **Conversion rate**
- Percentage of page visitors who purchase
---
- **Sales velocity**
- Units sold per day vs. category competitors
---
- **Click-through rate**
- How often your listing is clicked in results
---
- **Keyword relevance**
- How precisely content matches search intent
---
- **External traffic**
- Clicks from Google, social media, email campaigns
---
- **Seller authority**
- Account age, health metrics, policy compliance
---
- **Review velocity**
- New reviews per 30 days + average star rating
---
- **Fulfillment method**
- FBA Prime eligibility advantage
{% /table %}

Many sellers slip up with this in that their business is heavily influenced by internal traffic, however if demand is created outside of Amazon, it will come back through to you, which is exactly what we aim for with our Amazon SEO Services in addition to off-page optimization.

---

## Amazon SEO vs. Google SEO: Why They Need Different Strategies

{% table %}
- Factor
- Amazon SEO
- Google SEO
---
- **Primary goal**
- Drive purchases
- Serve relevant information
---
- **Ranking currency**
- Sales performance + conversion rate
- Domain authority + backlinks
---
- **Content format**
- Title, bullets, backend fields, A+ content
- Long-form pages, meta tags, blog posts
---
- **Link building**
- Not applicable inside Amazon
- Central ranking factor
---
- **Review impact**
- Direct ranking signal
- Indirect via schema markup only
---
- **Page speed**
- Amazon controls-not a seller concern
- Critical technical SEO factor
{% /table %}

Anyone using Google SEO logic on an Amazon account does poorly. The two search engines reward different actions entirely. And this is our Amazon SEO agency’s bread and butter.

---

## Our Amazon SEO Process

**Step 1-Discovery and Audit (Week 1)** Full account audit, competitor analysis, keyword gap identification, and baseline rank benchmarking across your target ASINs.

**Step 2-Strategy and Keyword Architecture (Week 1–2)** Three-tier keyword map built per ASIN, intent-categorized and prioritized by conversion potential and competitive gap.

**Step 3-Listing Optimization and Content Deployment (Week 2–3)** Title rewrites, bullet and description overhaul, backend search term rebuild, A+ content creation, and image sequence review.

**Step 4-Review Velocity and External Traffic Activation (Month 1–2)** Review acquisition workflows activated. External traffic campaigns structured to send A10-positive demand signals to priority ASINs.

**Step 5-CRO Testing and Rank Monitoring (Month 2 Onward)** A/B testing launched via Manage Your Experiments. Monthly reporting covers organic keyword rank, Unit Session Percentage, attributed organic sales, Share of Voice, and review velocity.

