## Real Results: What Amazon SEO Actually Delivers

**Private Label Kitchenware Brand** I'm stalled on page 4 for stainless steel water bottle. Re-structuring backend keywords, A+ content, and three rounds of testing my main image and after A/B I got to page 1 in 90 days. Organic sales up 340% and spend is unchanged.

**Wholesale Electronics Reseller (200+ ASINs)** Added repetitive title terms into the backend fields on 60+ ASINs which wasted indexing space. Following the clean up, Tier 3 long tail integration and a review velocity initiative, the organic rank of the top 20 ASINs increased from average of 18 to 6 in 4 months.

**D2C Supplement Brand** PPC spending was hiding an absence of organic search traffic. Outside traffic initiative- targeting key ASINs through influencer promotions and email blasts- boosted keyword rank by 11 positions in under 60 days. This also led to a 28% reduction in the overall advertising Cost of Sales.

